# pixelarticons specific
# svgtofont also emits fonts/react and fonts/vue. Both are broken: the React
# files are JSX inside .js (and carry a stray comma between paths), and the Vue
# files declare viewBox="0 0 20 20" for 24x24 artwork. The hand-rolled react/
# directory is the supported one, so neither ships.
